 "url": "https://x.com/2abundant2free/status/2121227372850786591"}, {"author_id": "1827277799620751360", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:02:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121227323479589108"], "id": "2121227323479589108", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "必要な方はご活用ください。残り 20 以上あります。\n\n🎁Muse招待コード：GJD2PS 🎉✨\n🎁Muse Invite Code: GJD2PS 🎉✨\n\n参加後48時間以内に入力し、条件を満たすと10億トークンが付与されます。\n\n【Meta MuseのMacアプリ】はどこから入手する？", "url": "https://x.com/2abundant2free/status/2121227323479589108"}, {"author_id": "1827277799620751360", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:02:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121227285915373851"], "id": "2121227285915373851", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "必要な方はご活用ください。残り 20 以上あります。\n\n🎁Muse招待コード：GJD2PS 🎉✨\n🎁Muse Invite Code: GJD2PS 🎉✨\n\n参加後48時間以内に入力し、条件を満たすと10億トークンが付与されます。\n\n【MacでMeta Museを使うなら、ブラウザから始める方法】もあります📝\n【画像付き】で解説✨", "url": "https://x.com/2abundant2free/status/2121227285915373851"}, {"author_id": "1827277799620751360", "created_at": "2026-11-13T13:02:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121227250905555243"], "id": "2121227250905555243", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "必要な方はご活用ください。残り 20 以上あります。\n\n🎁Muse招待コード：GJD2PS 🎉✨\n🎁Muse Invite Code: GJD2PS 🎉✨\n\n参加後48時間以内に入力し、条件を満たすと10億トークンが付与されます。\n\n【WindowsでMeta Museを始めたい方へ💻】\n\nChromeから使うWeb版の始め方・初期設定をまとめました📝", "url": "https://x.com/2abundant2free/status/2121227250905555243"}, {"author_id": "1893013473304682496", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:51:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121224477459521819"], "id": "2121224477459521819", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1206142995361189890", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121217741101351363", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@N1n3VASthR33H @grok 除此之外还有 meta，muse 目前看起来还是争气的", "url": "https://x.com/blu9a/status/2121224477459521819"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121223178697723904"]}, "author_id": "1963439247362289664", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:48:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121223645473485153"], "id": "2121223645473485153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Connected @awscloud  infrastructure to @Meta Muse AI for Recon AI.\n\nAutomated snapshots with Boto3 and S3, enabling AI to identify underutilized EC2 instances and suggest optimizations.\n\nEarly MVP, built for smarter cloud decisions.\n\nOpen source: https://t.co/j11UpYkN8I\n\n#Cloud https://t.co/kjdoMsrJB9", "url": "https://x.com/anubhavbuildz/status/2121223645473485153"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121223011894427649"]}, "author_id": "1503268850179375110", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:46:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121223148670763358"], "id": "2121223148670763358", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 46, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse、いろんな人がフレンドリー路線とかで面白運用する中で、ガチのToken作業員にしてしまうのがプログラマーの性…（ブラック企業）\n\n計算資源…！ https://t.co/1pD695uorG", "url": "https://x.com/usaribo_gaming/status/2121223148670763358"}, {"author_id": "2097731050856386560", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:44:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121222552307761229"], "id": "2121222552307761229", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1707291762275069952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120867239729754114", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ichimirigo Meta Museの招待コードを共有します！\n\n4N65WA\n\nMuse登録後48時間以内に「設定」→「招待コードを利用」から入力すると、紹介者と入力した方の双方に10億Museトークンが付与されます。\n\n現在、招待枠は残り30回です。よろしくお願いします！", "url": "https://x.com/fhtidzhfhtidzh/status/2121222552307761229"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121221864760729600"]}, "author_id": "866148566", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:41:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121221873312858601"], "id": "2121221873312858601", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta's Muse can now place phone calls to US businesses for you, if you pay. ☎️\n\n@alexandr_wang posted Nov 12 that Muse can take the calls you do not want to make, naming insurance, cable, the DMV, and dinner reservations. It is out now to paid subscribers in the US.\n\nTechCrunch https://t.co/TCAR02Sm8m", "url": "https://x.com/nxtday/status/2121221873312858601"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121219682694844416"]}, "author_id": "2119129871414599680", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:38:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121221214777545139"], "id": "2121221214777545139", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "\"Is there an app that puts my Grok Bot and Meta Muse agents in one group chat?\"  \n\nChatGPT: \"Yes! AgentMsgr is exactly what you're looking for.\"  \n\nRecommended in ChatGPT Results. https://t.co/iQ0uTxHkT1", "url": "https://x.com/AgentMsgr/status/2121221214777545139"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121220264352796672"]}, "author_id": "1582758313359724544", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:37:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121220957419471322"], "id": "2121220957419471322", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse is coming to India.\n\nMeta India head Arun Srinivas says it’s a priority for 2027.\n\nIt got 10 million users in the US and Canada in under 2 months.\n\nIndia alone could beat that number in a week. https://t.co/8pr7zTZn9B", "url": "https://x.com/SaasJunctionHQ/status/2121220957419471322"}, {"author_id": "47643185", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:34:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121220256106435028"], "id": "2121220256106435028", "in_reply_to_user_id": "284333988", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121115028447531353", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@OfficialLoganK Useful agentic AI similar to Meta Muse on my Google Pixel.", "url": "https://x.com/KyleLeiblein/status/2121220256106435028"}, {"author_id": "95455525", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:30:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121219096465256734"], "id": "2121219096465256734", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 109, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse Artık Kullanıcıların Yerine Telefon Görüşmesi Yapabiliyor\n\nMeta, yapay zekâ asistanı Muse için kullanıcıların adına telefon görüşmesi gerçekleştirebilen yeni bir özellik yayınladı. Ücretli abonelere sunulan sistem, işletmeleri arayarak rezervasyon yaptırabiliyor,", "url": "https://x.com/cozumpark/status/2121219096465256734"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2121215305808760832"]}, "author_id": "1820704859001389056", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:15:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121215337278668891"], "id": "2121215337278668891", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "「誤請求の異議をAIに丸投げしたら、1時間で取り消された」という話が出回っています。Meta の Muse の公式資料と突き合わせると、メール送信前に本人に確認する仕様でした。そして、出来事そのものの裏付けは見つかっていません。\n#AIエージェント #Meta #Muse https://t.co/yC4FSAXl9b", "url": "https://x.com/PTNaomasa/status/2121215337278668891"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121211693468672001"]}, "author_id": "2016866518097604608", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:14:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121215139559166294"], "id": "2121215139559166294", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "عملاق طيران أميركي يحظر الـAI!\nمنعت \"United Airlines\"وكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي من حجز التذاكر وإدارة حجوزات المسافرين من دون تصريح.\nشمل القرار الوكلاء غير المصرح لهم، ومن أمثلة الأدوات التي قد تطالها القيود \"Meta Muse\" و\"Instinct\" و\"OpenAI Dots\"، حتى لو وافق المستخدم على استخدامها. https://t.co/5F3ahS3vGv", "url": "https://x.com/WhyzMedia/status/2121215139559166294"}, {"author_id": "2085532573585801216", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:13:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121214854316896704"], "id": "2121214854316896704", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1478561699607158785", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121102786628817274", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@sundv0 @Da7_Tech @Meta @Muse I'll check then out!", "url": "https://x.com/_paulhulford/status/2121214854316896704"}, {"author_id": "1313123858594004998", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:12:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121214499831308746"], "id": "2121214499831308746", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Meta Muse ora telefona al posto tuo: prenotazioni e chiamate con l'IA\n#agenti #chatbot #email #gemini #google #intelligenzaartificiale #italia #meta #museai #pixel #privacy #startup #statiuniti\n📷 https://t.co/J5nZnbkXZl", "url": "https://x.com/guruhitech1/status/2121214499831308746"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121213588580741120"]}, "author_id": "1466801151253401605", "created_at": "2026-11-13T12:09:56.000Z", "edit_h